{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26782","headline":"及第後夜中书事 · 姚合","name":"及第後夜中书事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜睡常惊起，春光属野夫。\n新衔添一字，旧友逊前途。\n喜过还疑梦，狂来不似儒。\n爱花持烛看，忆酒犯街沽。\n天上名应定，人间盛更无。\n报恩丞相合，何啻杀微躯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26782.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26782","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}